  "reasoning": "The defendant organized and participated in multiple incidents of illegal logging (盗伐林木) in forest areas under the jurisdiction of a mining company, knowingly cutting trees that did not belong to him, selling the timber for profit, and distributing the proceeds. This conduct constitutes the crime of illegal cutting and destruction of forest resources under Chinese criminal law (非法采伐、毁坏森林资源罪). No other distinct crimes are indicated in the facts.",
